  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: Adds optional, disabled-by-default communication diagnostics with transport-submitted Read, Browse, BrowseNext, SETASG and CLRASG counters; service and gate-wait timing; pending counts; SDK token activation/renewal metadata; session, KeepAlive and reconnect records; and bounded recent/frozen failure history. No additional robot requests are generated and no sensitive payloads or key material are retained. Existing APIs and default transport behavior are preserved. Verified with offline fake-channel tests; live token-renewal behavior has not yet been validated on a physical controller.",
